<TcPlcObject Version="1.1.0.1" ProductVersion="3.1.4026.8">
  <Itf Name="ICloneable" Id="{68483ec3-b439-4b9c-83b4-d1a108ddfc10}">
    <Declaration><![CDATA[(*

## Short summary

Interface to clone objects.
Cloning is necessary when an object is to be edited
and at the same time the origin must remain unchangeable.
This is the case, for example, if you have a list of teach points
and a camera generates an offset for all teach points,
then there is a deepClone of the list
and then the offset is calculated for each teach point.  

.. <legal notes>

legal notes
=================
